## Smoke-test fixes (done)

- Builder meta: status allow-list includes `pending_review`/`rejected`; thumbnail via `POST` + `_method=PUT`
- Lesson `video_url` accepts relative/storage paths
- Question bank `[id]` resolves `courseId` when query missing
- Academic pickers use `/admin/students` + `/admin/instructors` (not ignored `user_type`)
- Quiz create requires ≥1 question
- Dynamic i18n gaps: closed/archived/assignment/scorm

## Out / stub giữ nguyên (không trong menu demo)

- exam-monitor, payouts, points, email-templates, reports/errors, lnd/reports

## Communications (done)

- Gửi thông báo admin + SMTP test + chuông poll 15s
- Tin tức CMS admin + portal `/news`

## Builder scope

**In:** video, page, file, quiz — sections/lessons reorder, publish, video upload  
**Deferred:** SCORM/H5P/assignment/live class, rich-text nâng cao

